### Page 1 of 1

```text
PUBLIC SERVICES COMMITTEE
MINUTES
A meeting of the Public Services Committee was held on Tuesday, March 5, 2024, in Committee
Room 104 and via electronic meeting, starting at 12:00 p.m. Those in attendance were as follows:
COMMITTEE MEMBERS: Scott Roybal, Chairnrnn. Pete Laybourn, Dr. Rinne, and Tom
Segrave.
AGENDA ITEMS
10.
ORDINANCE —2 READING
— Amending Section 10.12.160, Authority to Impound
Illegally Parked Vehicles, and Section 10.12.170, Immobilization, of Chapter 10.12,
Administration and Enforcement, of Title 10, Vehicles and Traffic, of the Municipal Code
of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, modifying specified enforcement provisions regarding
vehicle impoundment. (SPONSOR
— MR. JOHNSON)
Dr. Rinne moved to approve on 2n reading, seconded by Mr. Segrave.
Motion carried by
unanimous voice vote.
Lieutenant Joel Hickerson. Police Department. provided a staff report and John Brodie. Deputy
City Attorney, provided additional information.
Committee members Laybourn. Rinne, and
Segrave commented on the item.
There being no further items for the agenda to come before the Public Services Committee, the
meeting was adjourned at 12:11 p.m.
Submitted by,
Jennifer McClelland
Executive Assistant to the Cheyenne City Council
```
